{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：15:05 2026-11-25 HKT<br/>發佈時間：15:05 2026-11-25 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：15:05 2026-11-25 HKT</p><img alt=\"警員到場調查。曾志恒攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/0aadaab3e3dba5a6560591c7b3b70ec8/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-25_at_15_26_48.jpeg\"/><p>大埔富善邨善美樓，今（25日）中午1時46分，一名男子報案指，遭另一名男子尾隨上樓入屋襲擊，其間劫走他的手機、銀包，內有2萬元，並搶去他的金頸鏈、金手鈪及金戒指，糾纏間事主被打傷頭，匪徒得手後逃之夭夭。救援人員接報到場，發現事主頭部流血、面及鼻腫，四肢擦傷，將他送往大埔那打素醫院治理，警方將案列搶劫，正追緝涉案男賊。</p><img alt=\"警員到場調查。曾志恒攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/5b626f71c8af5aa6e21e9cc80712e60f/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-25_at_15_27_38.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"探員到善美樓調查。曾志恒攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ff88720d3fe5c5c7fbdc9501e4cfdf65/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-25_at_15_27_37.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/5aa37721f634cba56d41dd98189b07fd/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-25_at_15_26_47_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員到場調查。曾志恒攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/98c3ea6218b1ad264bd99eddee3b8e84/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-25_at_15_26_47.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/cfc6a9b158afee991fb3b1b1b789add4/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-25_at_15_26_46.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"事主被尾隨上樓打劫。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/651a9cd1c694d05092be4aa20cfe4d5b/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-25_at_15_26_45_1_.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T08:03:57.634269+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":242,"images":7,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T07:05:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T07:57:21.298921+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T07:57:21.298921+00:00","content_hash":"2fbad0e2d17497ea3b194f9ccf0f1bdd4d64ed2789f7d02be434ddc107d2550f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}